  "abstract": "A community catalogue linking Canadian forest and soil carbon observations, environmental covariates, studies, maps and Earth Engine assets. Distinguishes geographic domain, native/output spatial support, time, depth and evidence. This is a catalogue release candidate, not a new carbon map or completed comparison analysis."
